  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection et assistance d&#x2019;urgence aux populations affect&#xe9;es par la crise soudanaise</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide multi-sectoral refugee assistance to refugees in, Abdi, Assoungha, Iriba, Ouadda, Ouara. This UNHCR project conducts biometric registration, facilitates the voluntary relocation of refugees, distributes US$640,000 through cash and voucher assistance, and established 3,000 emergency shelters. This project provides humanitarian assistance to 40,000 people, including 9,000 women, 9,000 men, 22,000 children, and including 1,500 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
